=== SURVEY ===
Date: 2026-04-25
Depends-on: phase-14/00-hypertable (commit 23515e00)

Files examined:
  - internal/database/signal_history_writer.go  (flush() uses CopyFrom into signal_log)
  - internal/mqtt/mqtt.go                       (NewClient appends randomSuffix to ClientID)
  - internal/mqtt/subscriber.go                 (Start() subscribes to {topicBase}/+/v/#)
